@ReactAppDvd.Server_HostAddress = http://localhost:5197

### Authentication status
GET {{ReactAppDvd.Server_HostAddress}}/auth/status

### Register a server-backed account
POST {{ReactAppDvd.Server_HostAddress}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "new-user@example.com",
  "username": "new-user",
  "password": "Example123!"
}

### Log in
POST {{ReactAppDvd.Server_HostAddress}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "new-user",
  "password": "Example123!"
}

### Log out
POST {{ReactAppDvd.Server_HostAddress}}/logout
